\fs36 \cf0 This script surveys the selected playlist for tracks whose files cannot be located on a local drive -- generally, these are the tracks in the playlist with 
\f1\b "!"
\f0\b0  next to their track names -- and asks to delete those tracks en masse from the playlist.\
\
This script is not capable of deleting files.\
\
However, you are advised to use this script thoughtfully and cautiously.\
\
The latest version of this scripts ignores streams that may be mixed in with your sound file tracks.\

